Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:39.69,Character-TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(1564.8,602)}{\b1}乔尔·米勒{\b0}\N{\fs44}波士顿走私者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:40.49,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hbfbfbf\alpha&H19&\fs48\fad(500,500)\pos(486.4,1006.8)}翻译\N{\fs64}{\b1}疾火 ＆ 叽拇啾 & 北落
