Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:05.97,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx107\fscy157\c&Hf0f5f5\fad(800,0)\pos(369.6,800.4)}波士顿以西10英里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.69,0:02:20.69,Character-TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(1283.2,526.8)}{\b1}艾莉·威廉姆斯{\b0}\N{\fs44}波士顿生还者
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.97,0:02:29.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你外套还要吗？\N{\fs50}You want your jacket back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.04,0:02:57.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我从没到过树林里\N{\fs50}I've never been in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:03.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,虫子比我想得多\N{\fs50}More bugs than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.05,0:03:10.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听着 我一直在想——\N{\fs50}Look, I've been thinking about--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:10.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不想听你道歉\N{\fs50}I don't want your sorries.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:12.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没想要道歉\N{\fs50}I wasn't gonna say I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.51,0:03:15.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是想说 我一直在想之前的事情\N{\fs50}I was gonna say that I've been thinking about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.64,0:03:17.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没人逼你或者泰丝带上我\N{\fs50}Nobody made you or Tess take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:19.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没人逼你接受这个计划\N{\fs50}Nobody made you go along with this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:22.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你需要卡车电池还是啥的\N{\fs50}You needed a truck battery or whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.31,0:03:24.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,于是你做了选择\N{\fs50}and you made a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.19,0:03:27.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这不是我的错 所以别怪我头上\N{\fs50}So don't blame me for something that isn't my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.63,0:03:53.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还要多久？\N{\fs50}How much longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.97,0:03:55.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,徒步五小时\N{\fs50}Five-hour hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.10,0:03:58.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没啥问题\N{\fs50}We can manage that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:27.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这条路你常走吗？\N{\fs50}You've gone this way a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:29.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有感染者？\N{\fs50}No Infected?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.12,0:04:30.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不常走 没有\N{\fs50}Not often, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:32.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那你在留意什么？\N{\fs50}What are you looking out for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.18,0:04:34.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,人\N{\fs50}People.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.09,0:04:36.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔和弗兰克人好吗？\N{\fs50}Are Bill and Frank nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:38.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,弗兰克不错\N{\fs50}Frank is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.43,0:04:42.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你头上那道疤怎么来的？\N{\fs50}How'd you get that scar on your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.89,0:04:44.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,咋了？来历很丢人吗？\N{\fs50}What? Is it something lame?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:45.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比如说你跌下楼梯了之类的？\N{\fs50}Like you fell down the stairs or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.98,0:04:47.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是因为跌下楼梯\N{\fs50}I didn't fall down any stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:48.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行 那咋来的？\N{\fs50}Okay, so what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:50.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有人朝我开枪 但射偏了\N{\fs50}Someone shot at me and missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.57,0:04:52.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,瞧 这就很酷\N{\fs50}See, that's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.65,0:04:54.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你射回去了吗？\N{\fs50}You shoot back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:54.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:55.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,打中他了吗？\N{\fs50}You get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:58.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有 我也射偏了\N{\fs50}No, I missed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:05:00.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这种事常有 不是你以为的那样\N{\fs50}It happens more often than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.79,0:05:03.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是因为大家枪法很烂 还是因为 本来就这样？\N{\fs50}'Cause you suck at shooting or, like, in general?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.17,0:05:07.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,都这样\N{\fs50}In general.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.63,0:05:16.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说 现在就咱俩了\N{\fs50}You know, seeing as it's just the two of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:17.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我觉得我最好还是——\N{\fs50}I was thinking I should pro--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:18.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.23,0:05:29.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,坎伯兰农场\N{\fs50}Cumberland Farms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.90,0:05:32.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你在这等下\N{\fs50}Hang back a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.94,0:05:35.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我去拿上我藏起来的东西\N{\fs50}I gotta grab some stuff I stashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.09,0:05:35.24,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-仅边框,,0,0,0,,{\frx358\fry10\pos(1468.8,552.4)\c&H4e5258\b1\3c&Ha7c5db}坎伯兰农场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:36.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,藏？\N{\fs50}Stashed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.53,0:05:37.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你为什么要在这里藏东西？\N{\fs50}Why do you have stuff stashed here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.78,0:05:39.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你的问题真他妈不少\N{\fs50}You ask a lot of goddamn questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:41.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 没错\N{\fs50}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:47.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 你是要不要回答我？\N{\fs50}So, are you gonna answer me or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:50.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们会在沿途藏点补给\N{\fs50}We hide supplies on routes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.63,0:05:52.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,以免路上装备不足\N{\fs50}in case we find ourselves short on gear,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.59,0:05:54.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而我现在就缺装备 因为——\N{\fs50}which I currently am 'cause--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.36,0:05:56.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是吧！\N{\fs50}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:06:00.30,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-仅边框,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0b2c4b\b1\bord3\frz355.9\pos(1227.2,294.8)}真人快打2
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.22,0:05:59.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你玩过这个吗？\N{\fs50}You ever play this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.39,0:06:02.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我有个朋友对这游戏很熟\N{\fs50}I had a friend who knew everything about this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:04.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有个叫美莲娜的角色 她只要摘下面具\N{\fs50}There's this one character named Mileena who takes off her mask
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.02,0:06:07.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就会露出一口獠牙 然后把你整个吞下去\N{\fs50}and she has monster teeth and then she swallows you whole
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:08.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,再吐出你的骨头来\N{\fs50}and barfs out your bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:12.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哎呀 真的是\N{\fs50}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:17.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你忘记藏哪儿了\N{\fs50}You forgot where you put your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.99,0:06:20.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有 我只是整理一下\N{\fs50}No, I'm just zeroing in on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:22.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,上次来已经是几年前了\N{\fs50}It's been a couple of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:25.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吧 那我要四处逛逛 看看有没有啥好东西\N{\fs50}Okay, well, I'm gonna take a look around, see if there's anything good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.83,0:06:27.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,相信我 好的早被挑完了\N{\fs50}Trust me, it's all been picked over already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.66,0:06:29.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许吧 看看呗\N{\fs50}Maybe, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:32.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,里边有什么坏东西吗？\N{\fs50}Is there anything bad in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:33.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就你而已\N{\fs50}Just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:35.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,越说越好笑\N{\fs50}Getting funnier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:39.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:14.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fs50}You all right back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:15.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事！\N{\fs50}Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:24.09,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(1284.8,501.2)\b1}丹碧丝 珍珠系列
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.82,0:08:24.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,太好了我操\N{\fs50}Fuck yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.86,0:10:23.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉？\N{\fs50}Ellie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:32.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉！\N{\fs50}Ellie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:41.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉？\N{\fs50}Ellie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:46.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,挑完了个屁\N{\fs50}Picked over, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:01.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fs50}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.69,0:11:04.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这把枪 弹药不好找\N{\fs50}There's not much ammo out there for this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.19,0:11:05.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,基本就没啥用\N{\fs50}Makes it mostly useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.69,0:11:07.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 你要是把它扔这 还不如……\N{\fs50}Well, if you're just gonna leave it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:10.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:27.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fs50}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:32.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你坐那个飞过吗？\N{\fs50}You fly in one of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.97,0:11:34.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 有几次吧\N{\fs50}Few times, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.20,0:11:35.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真走运啊\N{\fs50}So lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:38.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当时可没这感觉\N{\fs50}Didn't feel like it at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.23,0:11:41.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,挤在中间的位子上 一个三明治卖12块\N{\fs50}Get shoved into a middle seat, pay 12 bucks for a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.19,0:11:43.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,老兄 你都到天上了\N{\fs50}Dude, you got to go up in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:47.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这个嘛 他们也是\N{\fs50}Yeah, well, so did they.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:54.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好惨哦\N{\fs50}Grim.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.28,0:11:58.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 一切都在一天里崩溃了？\N{\fs50}So everything came crashing down in one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:11:59.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fs50}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:00.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么会？\N{\fs50}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:03.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说 本来没有人感染虫草菌\N{\fs50}I mean, no one was infected with Cordyceps,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:04.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,大家都好好的\N{\fs50}everybody's fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.88,0:12:07.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在餐厅吃饭 坐飞机上天\N{\fs50}eating in restaurants and flying in planes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:10.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后 一下子就这样了？\N{\fs50}And then, all at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.51,0:12:12.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,疫情怎么开始的？\N{\fs50}How did it even start?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:14.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果你得被咬才会感染\N{\fs50}If you have to get bit to be infected,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.30,0:12:16.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那是谁咬了第一个人？\N{\fs50}then who bit the first person?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:18.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是不是猴子？我猜是猴子\N{\fs50}Was it a monkey? I bet it was a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.31,0:12:20.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是猴子 你怎么上的学\N{\fs50}It wasn't a monkey. I thought you went to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.23,0:12:21.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,FEDRA的学校\N{\fs50}FEDRA school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.69,0:12:23.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们才不会告诉我们 他们的狗屎政府\N{\fs50}They don't teach us how their shitty government
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:25.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是怎么让疫情失控的\N{\fs50}failed to prevent a pandemic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:33.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没人能确定 但 最靠谱的猜测是\N{\fs50}No one knows for sure, but, best guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.07,0:12:35.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,虫草菌变异了\N{\fs50}Cordyceps mutated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.45,0:12:38.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,其中一些进到了食物供应链里\N{\fs50}And some of it got into the food supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.49,0:12:41.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可能污染了面粉或者糖这类基本食材\N{\fs50}Probably a basic ingredient like flour or sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:44.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有些牌子的食物哪儿都有卖\N{\fs50}There were certain brands of food that were sold everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.67,0:12:46.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,卖到全国 甚至是全球\N{\fs50}all across the country, across the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.79,0:12:50.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,面包 麦片 松饼粉\N{\fs50}Bread, cereal, pancake mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.55,0:12:55.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你吃够分量 就会感染\N{\fs50}You eat enough of it, it'll get you infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:59.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,情况就是 被污染的食物都在同一天\N{\fs50}So the tainted food all hits the store shelves
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.18,0:13:00.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,上了货架 这天是周四\N{\fs50}around the same time, Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.73,0:13:05.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,人们买回家 周四晚上或者周五早上吃了点\N{\fs50}People bought it, ate some Thursday night or Friday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.77,0:13:09.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,几个小时过去 他们开始生病\N{\fs50}Day goes on, they started to get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.27,0:13:13.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,到了下午 或者晚上 病情更重了\N{\fs50}Afternoon, evening, they got worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.57,0:13:17.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后就开始咬人了\N{\fs50}Then they started bitin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:22.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,2003年9月26日 周五 晚上\N{\fs50}Friday night, September 26, 2003.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.92,0:13:28.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等到了周一 全完了\N{\fs50}And by Monday, everything was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.47,0:13:37.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听着比猴子合理\N{\fs50}It makes more sense than monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:39.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fs50}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.93,0:13:42.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没啥\N{\fs50}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:47.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,咋了？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:50.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们从树林里穿过去\N{\fs50}We'll cut across the woods here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.25,0:13:51.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走大路不方便些？\N{\fs50}Isn't the road easier?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:54.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是 只是——\N{\fs50}Yeah, it's just--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.49,0:13:56.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,路上有你不该看的东西\N{\fs50}There's stuff up there you shouldn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.86,0:13:59.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这下我非看不可了\N{\fs50}Well, now I have to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.14,0:14:00.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不想让你看到\N{\fs50}I don't want you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:02.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说真的 艾莉\N{\fs50}Serious. Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:04.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,会伤着我吗？\N{\fs50}Can it hurt me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:05.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:08.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你太老实了 老兄\N{\fs50}You're too honest, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:10.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你该说有斧头杀人狂的\N{\fs50}Should've said axe murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.30,0:14:18.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,无论那是啥\N{\fs50}Whatever it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.39,0:14:20.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,多半都没了\N{\fs50}I think it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.03,0:14:44.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,疫情爆发大概一周后 士兵们……\N{\fs50}About a week after Outbreak Day, soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:49.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,穿过郊野 来疏散周边小镇\N{\fs50}went through the countryside, evacuated the small towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.83,0:14:53.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,说带你去隔离区 但其实有个前提\N{\fs50}Told you you were goin' to a QZ, and you were,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.63,0:14:56.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,隔离区得有名额\N{\fs50}if there was room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.01,0:14:59.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要是没名额……\N{\fs50}If there wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.23,0:15:10.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这些人没生病？\N{\fs50}These people weren't sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:12.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 大概率没有\N{\fs50}No, probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.61,0:15:18.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么要杀他们？\N{\fs50}Why kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.45,0:15:21.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么不让他们自生自灭？\N{\fs50}Why not just leave 'em be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.91,0:15:24.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,死人不会被感染\N{\fs50}Dead people can't be infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.53,0:15:40.66,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx107\fscy157\c&Hf0f5f5\fad(800,0)\pos(1545.6,861.2)}2003年9月30日
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.10,0:15:52.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,妈妈在 妈妈在\N{\fs50}Mommy's here. Mommy's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:25.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 长官 我们到地窖了 这里没人\N{\fs50}No, sir. We're in the basement now. There's no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.10,0:16:27.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,回头和其它人确认吧\N{\fs50}Let's check back with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:32.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,时候未到 新秩序暴政的狗腿子们\N{\fs50}Not today, you New World Order jackboot fucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.65,0:16:47.43,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-仅边框,,0,0,0,,{\c&H4a4e7d\b1\3c&Ha6abb4\frz358.6\pos(857.6,235.6)}强制转移通知
