Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.64,0:18:37.89,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,你等着 那不用太久\N{\fs50}♪ You'll know it won't be long ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.52,0:18:43.57,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,我会把所有的爱都给你 小可爱\N{\fs50}♪ I'll give you all the love, little darling ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.65,0:18:46.40,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,从我离开时积攒到现在的爱 都给你\N{\fs50}♪ I've had in store for you since I've been gone ♪
