Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:25.94,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,这次我回家就不走了\N{\fs50}♪ This time I'm comin' home to stay ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:31.45,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,我这妈妈不像话\N{\fs50}♪ I'm gonna give you a no-good mother ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.53,0:19:34.20,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,但要日夜陪着你\N{\fs50}♪ Every night and every day ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.12,0:19:37.20,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,噢耶\N{\fs50}♪ Ohh yes ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.93,0:20:38.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,接着走啊\N{\fs50}Keep comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.12,0:20:58.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真是吃不腻\N{\fs50}It doesn't get old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.20,0:21:03.28,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,Cream《White Room》，发表于1968年
