Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.76,0:21:17.10,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,车站旁边的白色房间 挂着黑色的窗帘\N{\fs50}♪ In the white room with black curtains near the station ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.99,0:21:25.37,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx107\fscy157\c&Hf0f5f5\fad(500,500)\pos(228.8,744.4)}四年后
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.47,0:21:27.27,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,阴郁的乡村没有金色的铺地 椋鸟疲倦不已\N{\fs50}♪ Black roof country, no gold pavements, tired starlings ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:25.37,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx71\fscy114\c&Hf0f5f5\fad(500,500)\pos(211.2,813.2)}2007年
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.36,0:21:37.03,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,在你黑色的双眼中 银色的奔马顺着月光跃下\N{\fs50}♪ Silver horses ran down moonbeams in your dark eyes ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.61,0:21:31.13,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fs150\b1\c&H18161b\frx354\fry20\frz9.813\pos(300.8,926.8)}别踩我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.15,0:21:33.05,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\b1\c&H585053\alpha&H7F&\pos(608,550.8)}要么加入 要么死去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:42.91,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,你离去时 曙光微笑 我已满足\N{\fs50}♪ Dawn light smiles on you leaving my contentment ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.42,0:21:48.79,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,我将等待在——\N{\fs50}♪ I'll wait in th-- ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.18,0:22:01.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没感染！\N{\fs50}I'm not infected!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.06,0:22:04.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,带武器了么？\N{\fs50}Are you armed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.86,0:22:09.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.56,0:22:11.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么答得这么慢？\N{\fs50}Why did you take that long to answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.65,0:22:12.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fs50}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.78,0:22:15.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想过要撒谎\N{\fs50}I thought about lying for some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.40,0:22:17.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但编不出理由\N{\fs50}but a reason didn't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.61,0:22:21.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听我说 我是想去波士顿来着\N{\fs50}Look, I'm just trying to get to Boston.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.49,0:22:22.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就你自己？\N{\fs50}Alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.16,0:22:25.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们一开始是10个人\N{\fs50}We started with 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.16,0:22:27.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不过 确实 就我自己了\N{\fs50}But yeah, I'm alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.71,0:22:29.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从哪来？\N{\fs50}From where?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.13,0:22:30.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,巴尔的摩隔离区\N{\fs50}Baltimore QZ.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.79,0:22:33.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那儿已经没了\N{\fs50}It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.13,0:22:37.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗？\N{\fs50}Are ya hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.84,0:22:40.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,皮外伤而已\N{\fs50}There's just a bruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.65,0:22:54.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,唉 操\N{\fs50}Oh fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.21,0:23:14.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fs50}Stop there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:21.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你怎么弄到的？\N{\fs50}How'd you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.12,0:23:47.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去波士顿往那走\N{\fs50}Boston is that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.29,0:23:49.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你天黑前就能到\N{\fs50}You can make it by nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.98,0:23:51.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我快饿死了\N{\fs50}I'm really hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.96,0:23:53.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,两天没吃东西了\N{\fs50}I haven't eaten in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:23:59.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听起来倒也不算很久 对吧？\N{\fs50}It doesn't sound very long out loud, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.17,0:24:00.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,感觉过了很久\N{\fs50}It feels long.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.86,0:24:02.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我已经放了你了 赶紧走吧\N{\fs50}I'm letting you go, so go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.76,0:24:04.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 听着\N{\fs50}All right, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.35,0:24:06.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,首先 我叫弗兰克——\N{\fs50}First, my name's Frank--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.70,0:24:08.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗬 真稀奇 听清楚了 弗兰克\N{\fs50}Oh, yeah? Here's the thing, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.60,0:24:11.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果我给了你吃的 那每个跟你聊过天的流浪汉\N{\fs50}If I feed you, then every bum you talk to about it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.44,0:24:14.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,都会到这儿来讨一顿免费的午餐\N{\fs50}is gonna show up here lookin' for a free lunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.40,0:24:16.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这儿可不是阿比快餐\N{\fs50}and this is not an Arby's.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.42,0:24:17.40,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,阿比：美国大型三明治连锁快餐店
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.53,0:24:20.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,阿比哪有免费的午餐 餐厅得付钱\N{\fs50}Well, Arby's didn't have free lunch. It was a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.49,0:24:29.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不会和任何流浪汉之类的人提到这里 我发誓\N{\fs50}I won't talk about it to any bums, or hobos or vagabonds, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.42,0:24:39.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你看得出来 我不太会撒谎\N{\fs50}You already know I'm bad at lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.79,0:25:17.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这几件衣服是给你的\N{\fs50}I left some clothes here for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.42,0:25:20.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.38,0:25:22.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,衣服！\N{\fs50}Clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.97,0:25:25.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢谢你！马上完了\N{\fs50}Thank you! Almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.22,0:25:29.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我能多洗五分钟吗？\N{\fs50}Although can I have five more minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.89,0:25:30.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,随便\N{\fs50}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.43,0:25:32.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,随便！\N{\fs50}Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.93,0:25:36.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢谢你！太爽了！\N{\fs50}Thank you! This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.19,0:27:07.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我勒个操？\N{\fs50}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.65,0:27:10.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,肚子要饿了 吃什么都好吃\N{\fs50}Everything tastes good when you're starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.91,0:27:13.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是 但不会这么好吃\N{\fs50}Yeah, but not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.33,0:27:16.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fs50}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.86,0:27:26.19,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-仅边框,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\c&H06090d\bord1.5\pos(886.4,656.4)}博若莱村庄级
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.21,0:27:29.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一个还懂得用博若莱配兔肉的人\N{\fs50}A man who knows to pair rabbit with a Beaujolais.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.47,0:27:31.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道我看着不像这种人\N{\fs50}I know I don't seem like the type.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.68,0:27:33.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 你看着像\N{\fs50}No, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.92,0:28:07.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,菜还有 如果——\N{\fs50}There is more, if--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.94,0:28:09.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 我吃不下了\N{\fs50}No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.38,0:28:12.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我也想 相信我\N{\fs50}I want to, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.26,0:28:13.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但……\N{\fs50}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.31,0:28:17.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fs50}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.10,0:28:23.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fs50}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.90,0:28:28.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fs50}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.41,0:28:40.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那么 我想我该走了\N{\fs50}So, I guess I'll be going then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.38,0:28:50.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但还有件事\N{\fs50}But first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.97,0:28:58.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我老早就看见它了\N{\fs50}I've been staring at this the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.22,0:28:59.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是古董吗？\N{\fs50}Is it antique?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.41,0:29:00.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,1948年的\N{\fs50}1948.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.93,0:29:01.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fs50}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.93,0:29:03.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道这值多少钱吗？\N{\fs50}You know how much these are worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.85,0:29:05.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在一分钱不值\N{\fs50}Currently, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.98,0:29:10.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,《致爱丽丝》《霍夫曼的故事》 呕\N{\fs50}"Fur Elise." "Tales of Hoffmann"? Yuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.40,0:29:11.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这些才不是你的\N{\fs50}These aren't yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.47,0:29:13.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是我母亲的 你能别——\N{\fs50}My mother's. Could you not--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.28,0:29:15.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这才是你的\N{\fs50}This is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.20,0:29:24.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的天 是我的最爱\N{\fs50}Oh, my God, It's my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.98,0:29:29.78,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\frz3.255\pos(646.4,560.4)}琳达·朗丝黛精选
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.55,0:29:37.47,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,Linda Ronstadt《Long, Long Time》，发表于1970年
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.14,0:29:46.56,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,爱意会永存\N{\fs50}♪ Love will abide ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.65,0:29:52.15,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,不需……患得患失\N{\fs50}♪ Take... things in stride ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.23,0:29:56.86,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,这番——这番话似乎是金玉之言\N{\fs50}♪ Sounds like-- Sounds like good advice ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.95,0:30:02.08,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,但我身边 并无一人\N{\fs50}♪ But there's no one at my side ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.16,0:30:05.46,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 不 不 不 谢了 不好意思\N{\fs50}No. No. No, no, no, no. No, thank you. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.16,0:30:05.41,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,时——\N{\fs50}♪ And-- ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.54,0:30:06.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这首不行 这首不行\N{\fs50}Not this song. Not this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.90,0:30:08.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那个 我不是专业的\N{\fs50}Well, I'm not a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.00,0:30:10.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我也算不上 但这——\N{\fs50}Well, neither am I, but--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.68,0:30:19.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后我就走\N{\fs50}And then I'll leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.29,0:30:49.75,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,爱意会永存\N{\fs50}♪ Love will abide ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.00,0:30:54.67,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,不需患得患失\N{\fs50}♪ Take things in stride ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.42,0:31:00.39,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,这番话似乎是金玉之言\N{\fs50}♪ Sounds like good advice ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.47,0:31:05.77,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,但我身边 并无一人\N{\fs50}♪ But there's no one at my side ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.85,0:31:10.52,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,时间会冲淡\N{\fs50}♪ And time washes clean ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.02,0:31:16.15,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,爱恋的伤痕\N{\fs50}♪ Love's wounds unseen ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.07,0:31:22.16,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,曾有人对我如此说道\N{\fs50}♪ That's what someone told me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.24,0:31:26.33,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,话里的深意 我却一无所知\N{\fs50}♪ But I don't know what it means ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.41,0:31:33.17,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,因我不顾一切\N{\fs50}♪ 'Cause I've done everything I know ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.25,0:31:37.51,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,只为能赢得你\N{\fs50}♪ To try and make you mine ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.59,0:31:42.01,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,此情不移\N{\fs50}♪ And I think I'm gonna love you ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.22,0:31:48.60,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,地久天长\N{\fs50}♪ For a long, long time ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.66,0:32:08.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 那姑娘是谁？\N{\fs50}So, who's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.08,0:32:12.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你歌里的姑娘？\N{\fs50}Girl you're singing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.00,0:32:16.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有姑娘\N{\fs50}There is no girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.38,0:32:22.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我懂的\N{\fs50}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.96,0:32:59.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你叫什么？\N{\fs50}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.05,0:33:03.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fs50}Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.98,0:33:15.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去洗个澡 比尔\N{\fs50}Go take a shower, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.94,0:33:18.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.31,0:34:42.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你做过吗？\N{\fs50}Have you ever done this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.82,0:34:45.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,和谁都没做过？\N{\fs50}Not with anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.95,0:34:50.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 很久以前和一个姑娘——  - 是 我知道 那么\N{\fs50}-With a girl a long time ago-- -Yeah, I know, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.37,0:34:55.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我从简单的开始\N{\fs50}I'm gonna start with the simple things.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.91,0:34:59.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好\N{\fs50}-Okay. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.83,0:35:04.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但在我开始前 我想让你知道 我不是什么婊子\N{\fs50}But before I do, I want you to know that I'm not a whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.76,0:35:10.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不会为了午餐就跟人做爱\N{\fs50}I don't have sex for lunches,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.55,0:35:14.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,即便是丰盛大餐\N{\fs50}not even great ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.77,0:35:20.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 如果我跟人做了\N{\fs50}So, if I do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.81,0:35:24.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我得多留几天\N{\fs50}I am gonna stay for a few more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.65,0:35:27.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这样行吗？\N{\fs50}Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.45,0:35:29.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.74,0:35:30.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.84,0:36:10.97,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx107\fscy157\c&Hf0f5f5\fad(500,500)\pos(228.8,744.4)}三年后
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.36,0:36:08.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去你妈的！\N{\fs50}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.63,0:36:10.97,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx71\fscy114\c&Hf0f5f5\fad(500,500)\pos(211.2,813.2)}2010年
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.78,0:36:09.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,得了吧！\N{\fs50}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.74,0:36:12.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿！你能停下吗？\N{\fs50}Hey! Would you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.45,0:36:14.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我有要求过什么吗？有过吗？\N{\fs50}Do I ask for things? Ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.74,0:36:16.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我为什么要说这些？\N{\fs50}Why am I even saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.99,0:36:19.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这不是为了我 而是为了我们\N{\fs50}This isn't for me. This is for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.12,0:36:20.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谁在乎它们什么样？\N{\fs50}Who cares what they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.54,0:36:21.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在乎！\N{\fs50}I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.37,0:36:24.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们的家不止是这栋房子\N{\fs50}Our home isn't just our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.42,0:36:25.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而是我们周围的一切！\N{\fs50}It's everything around us!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.84,0:36:27.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他妈的得了吧！\N{\fs50}Give me a fuckin' break!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.61,0:36:29.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我都忘了\N{\fs50}I'm sorry, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.13,0:36:30.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我活在这个世界里\N{\fs50}I live in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.59,0:36:33.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而你活在神经病地堡里 你相信911是内鬼搞的\N{\fs50}You live in a psycho bunker where 9/11 was an inside job
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.84,0:36:35.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而政府官员全都是纳粹\N{\fs50}and the government are all Nazis.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.89,0:36:38.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,政府就是纳粹！\N{\fs50}The government are all Nazis!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.08,0:36:40.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 现在是！但以前不是啊！\N{\fs50}Well, yeah, now! But not then!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.23,0:36:47.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我就想要些颜料\N{\fs50}I am asking for some paint
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.48,0:36:49.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有割草机用的汽油\N{\fs50}and some gasoline for the lawnmower.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.36,0:36:51.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就这些 别的我都自己来\N{\fs50}That's all. I'll do everything else myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.74,0:36:53.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这不是一个——\N{\fs50}It is not a mat--
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.05,0:36:54.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔 如果你要说“资源管理”\N{\fs50}Bill, if you say "resource management,"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.74,0:36:57.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,饶了我吧 我现在就跑进你的陷阱里\N{\fs50}so help me, I will run through one of your trip wires.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.75,0:37:04.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fs50}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.88,0:37:07.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,告诉我原因\N{\fs50}Just tell me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.36,0:37:08.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说过了\N{\fs50}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.50,0:37:11.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,留意身边的事物\N{\fs50}Paying attention to things,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.76,0:37:15.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是我们表达爱意的方式\N{\fs50}it's how we show love.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.30,0:37:18.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这也是我的街道\N{\fs50}This is my street, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.93,0:37:21.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就让我用我的方式去爱它吧\N{\fs50}Just let me love it the way I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.35,0:37:26.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还要修整几家店铺\N{\fs50}And I'm fixing up some of the shops.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.90,0:37:28.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不修那些傻了吧唧的店\N{\fs50}Not the stupid ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.02,0:37:31.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只是红酒铺和家具店\N{\fs50}Just the wine shop and the furniture store.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.24,0:37:34.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有时装精品店\N{\fs50}And the clothing boutique.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.86,0:37:37.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,时装店？\N{\fs50}The boutique?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.08,0:37:40.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们是要举办很正式的花园派对了吗？\N{\fs50}Are we hosting formal garden parties now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.70,0:37:41.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.41,0:37:45.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我们会有朋友的\N{\fs50}But we are gonna have friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.34,0:37:49.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fs50}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.01,0:37:54.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们会交上朋友\N{\fs50}We're gonna make friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.68,0:37:57.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后邀请他们来做客\N{\fs50}and we will invite them to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.55,0:38:04.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们没有朋友 弗兰克\N{\fs50}We don't have friends, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.31,0:38:08.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们永远不会有朋友 因为外边没有朋友可交\N{\fs50}We will never have friends because there are no friends to be had.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.69,0:38:11.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,呃 其实我一直在用广播和一个女的交谈 她人很好\N{\fs50}Well, I've actually been talking to a nice woman on the radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.40,0:38:14.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你什么？\N{\fs50}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.45,0:38:18.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这真是 真是太棒了\N{\fs50}Well, this really is just-- it's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.12,0:38:18.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fs50}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.62,0:38:20.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,拜托 能不能别……？\N{\fs50}Can you not, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.29,0:38:29.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 换了我也会这么做 - 你也是偏执型精神分裂症病人？\N{\fs50}-I'm the same way. -You're a paranoid schizophrenic, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.38,0:38:31.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我才不是\N{\fs50}I'm not schizophrenic.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.22,0:38:40.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 我能不能说几句 枪的事先放一边 我明白你的意思\N{\fs50}Well, can I just say, gun aside, which I get, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.91,0:38:40.12,Character-TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(1411.2,678.8)}{\b1}泰丝·瑟沃普勒斯{\b0}\N{\fs44}波士顿走私者\N乔尔的搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.93,0:38:45.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在这么美丽的地方 文明平和地进餐 多么美好？\N{\fs50}how nice this is to have a civilized meal in such a beautiful place?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.18,0:38:46.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好久不曾这样了\N{\fs50}It's been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.02,0:38:49.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说 想要谢谢你们\N{\fs50}I mean, I wanna thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.15,0:38:51.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,即使最终我们未能合作\N{\fs50}Even if we don't end up working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.61,0:38:52.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这一餐对我很有意义\N{\fs50}I really needed this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.40,0:38:55.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们当然会合作\N{\fs50}We are working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.28,0:39:00.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fs50}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.41,0:39:04.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对了 我们进屋去吧\N{\fs50}You know what? Let's go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.54,0:39:05.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,泰丝 我想给你看些东西\N{\fs50}Tess, I wanna show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.58,0:39:07.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我一直想看看你们的房子内部 - 把酒带上\N{\fs50}-I have been wanting to see inside. -Bring your wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.83,0:39:08.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 别进去 - 谢谢你\N{\fs50}-Not inside. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.79,0:39:09.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 进屋没错 - 弗兰克\N{\fs50}-Yes. -Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.00,0:39:10.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,弗兰克！\N{\fs50}Frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.68,0:39:22.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我理解你\N{\fs50}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.72,0:39:24.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果我的\N{\fs50}If my,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.10,0:39:28.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果我的伴侣\N{\fs50}if mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.98,0:39:34.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把陌生人带进自己家 我也不会高兴\N{\fs50}brought strangers into our situation, I wouldn't be happy either.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.65,0:39:37.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不过 他通过广播所能找到人里边\N{\fs50}But of all the people he could've found on the radio,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.11,0:39:39.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也就我们正好是勉强过活的体面人\N{\fs50}we're actually decent people just tryin' to get by.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.74,0:39:43.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 这么说来我可不是个幸运儿吗？\N{\fs50}Well, aren't I the lucky one?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.53,0:39:45.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们在隔离区有物资 那些东西你没有\N{\fs50}There's stuff we have in the QZ that you don't have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.79,0:39:49.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,书籍 药物 机器零件\N{\fs50}Books, medicine, machine parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.58,0:39:52.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们可以互相帮助 还有 把枪从我面前拿开\N{\fs50}We can help each other, and get that gun outta my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.39,0:40:05.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那么 你之前是个\N{\fs50}So, what, you were a
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.14,0:40:08.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,末日准备者 还是别的什么？\N{\fs50}prepper or somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.02,0:40:10.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“生存主义者”\N{\fs50}"Survivalist."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.52,0:40:14.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们也许是体面人 也许不是\N{\fs50}Maybe you are decent people, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.48,0:40:15.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,并不重要\N{\fs50}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.94,0:40:17.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们这儿自给自足\N{\fs50}We're self-sufficient here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.94,0:40:23.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不需要你或你的朋友把我们的生活搞复杂\N{\fs50}I don't need you or your friend complicating our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.03,0:40:25.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fs50}Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.58,0:40:30.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那边的围栏估计再用一年 顶多一年\N{\fs50}That fence has got a year on it, tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.25,0:40:34.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,镀锌铁丝网已经开始腐蚀了\N{\fs50}Galvanized wire already started to corrode.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.96,0:40:39.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我可以给你十卷拉伸度超强的铝线\N{\fs50}I can get you 10 spools of high-tensile aluminum.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.63,0:40:42.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,保证你余生无忧\N{\fs50}Last you the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.80,0:40:46.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们的余生\N{\fs50}Lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.73,0:40:53.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真给我了？\N{\fs50}Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.12,0:40:54.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没问题 又不是白送\N{\fs50}Yeah. It's not a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.06,0:40:56.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们还会回来 到时我们再交易\N{\fs50}You'll come back, we'll trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.59,0:40:57.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fs50}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.27,0:40:59.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,另外 我觉得我们应该\N{\fs50}And I had this idea that we should
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.57,0:41:02.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,给广播弄套代号 免得别人偷听\N{\fs50}use codes for the radio in case anyone's listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.32,0:41:04.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好主意 用什么呢？\N{\fs50}That's a good idea. Like, with what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.20,0:41:06.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想的是 比如 用年代\N{\fs50}I was thinking, like, the decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.20,0:41:08.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 80年代的歌 有麻烦了 当然 - 好\N{\fs50}-Like, '80s, trouble, of course. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.08,0:41:10.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,70年代……\N{\fs50}'70s...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.00,0:41:12.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,FEDRA永远不会出现在这里\N{\fs50}FEDRA's never gonna come up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.04,0:41:16.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那些游荡的感染者也闯不过你们的陷阱\N{\fs50}And you're well-protected against stray Infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.17,0:41:21.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但迟早会有袭击者找上门\N{\fs50}But sooner or later, there'll be raiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.67,0:41:25.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们能够突破你的围栏和绊网\N{\fs50}And they'll beat that fence and your tripwires.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.59,0:41:27.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这些人在晚上出现\N{\fs50}They'll come at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.55,0:41:29.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,悄无声息 全副武装\N{\fs50}quiet and armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.94,0:41:35.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们不会有事的\N{\fs50}We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.73,0:41:58.02,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx107\fscy157\c&Hf0f5f5\fad(500,500)\pos(228.8,744.4)}三年后
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.19,0:41:58.02,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx71\fscy114\c&Hf0f5f5\fad(500,500)\pos(211.2,813.2)}2013年
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.80,0:42:03.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,跟上来\N{\fs50}Pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.70,0:42:07.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 我跑不动了\N{\fs50}Hey, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.26,0:42:09.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,再跑一圈就好\N{\fs50}Just one more loop around.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.64,0:42:11.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我有东西要给你看\N{\fs50}I got something to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.68,0:42:14.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是那个\N{\fs50}Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.61,0:42:21.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快到了\N{\fs50}Nearly there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.40,0:42:26.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,再坚持一会儿\N{\fs50}You can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.45,0:42:29.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,究竟是什么？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.41,0:42:31.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fs50}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.62,0:42:33.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？\N{\fs50}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.77,0:42:34.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs50}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.67,0:42:45.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我用你的一把枪跟乔尔和泰丝换了包种子\N{\fs50}I traded Joel and Tess one of your guns for a packet of seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.88,0:42:48.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哪把枪？\N{\fs50}Which gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.43,0:42:50.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一把小的\N{\fs50}A little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.90,0:43:46.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fs50}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.78,0:43:48.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fs50}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.95,0:43:53.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我老得比你快\N{\fs50}Gettin' older faster than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.28,0:43:55.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你变老\N{\fs50}I like you older.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.20,0:44:00.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,老去意味着我们还在这里\N{\fs50}Older means we're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.30,0:44:07.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,干吗？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.01,0:44:13.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在遇见你之前 我从未感到过害怕\N{\fs50}I was never afraid before you showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.28,0:44:33.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别在这儿 别压着草莓\N{\fs50}Not on the strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.74,0:44:34.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,说得对\N{\fs50}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.86,0:45:12.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.66,0:45:17.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔！\N{\fs50}Bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.99,0:45:19.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔！\N{\fs50}Bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.75,0:45:22.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔？\N{\fs50}Bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.33,0:45:24.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔！\N{\fs50}Bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.62,0:46:05.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔！比尔！\N{\fs50}Bill! Bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.67,0:46:06.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,进屋去！\N{\fs50}Get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.13,0:46:12.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别！\N{\fs50}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.74,0:46:14.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们一起 你得进去\N{\fs50}We gotta get you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.51,0:46:15.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不！不！不！\N{\fs50}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.66,0:46:18.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔 快进去 马上！抓紧我\N{\fs50}Bill, inside, now! Hold on to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.85,0:46:21.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我扶着你 扶好了\N{\fs50}I gotcha. I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.81,0:46:26.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.90,0:46:31.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,慢慢躺下\N{\fs50}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.07,0:46:35.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事 没事 我们能搞定\N{\fs50}Okay, okay. We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.99,0:46:37.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们能搞定的\N{\fs50}We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.45,0:46:38.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你能先压着伤口吗？\N{\fs50}You hold your hand there for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.87,0:46:40.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,压紧了 把手压在那儿\N{\fs50}Hold, hold your hand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.29,0:46:45.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\N{\fs50}Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.92,0:46:47.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,弗兰克！\N{\fs50}Frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.65,0:46:48.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在这儿\N{\fs50}I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.17,0:46:50.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 弗兰克 把燃气开着！ - 我在这儿\N{\fs50}-Frank, leave the gas on! -I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.17,0:46:51.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我在 我在 - 把燃气开着\N{\fs50}-I'm right here. I'm right here. -Leave the gas on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.84,0:46:54.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,围栏 围栏可以对付他们剩下的人\N{\fs50}The fence, the fence'll kill the rest of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.21,0:46:55.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 好\N{\fs50}Okay, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.30,0:46:57.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我为你准备了一个单子\N{\fs50}I made a list for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.05,0:47:00.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,跟我说说你的单子\N{\fs50}Tell me about the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.26,0:47:02.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我备份了全部钥匙\N{\fs50}I have copies of all the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.89,0:47:04.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.93,0:47:07.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,联系乔尔\N{\fs50}Call Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.48,0:47:11.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不能独自待着\N{\fs50}You can't be here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.36,0:47:12.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可我并不是独自一人\N{\fs50}Well, I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.07,0:47:13.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你也在这儿\N{\fs50}You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.88,0:47:14.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不一样\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.61,0:47:16.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,联系乔尔\N{\fs50}Call Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.07,0:47:20.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 好了 我要开始了 - 不\N{\fs50}-Okay, here we go. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.49,0:47:23.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 没事的 放松 放松 - 联系乔尔 联系他\N{\fs50}-It's okay. It's okay. It's okay. -Call Joel. Call Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.21,0:47:30.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 他可以保护好你 - 我要处理伤口了\N{\fs50}-He'll take care of ya. -There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.63,0:47:39.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,会好的\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.84,0:47:41.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,会好的\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.52,0:47:52.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔？\N{\fs50}{\i1}Bill?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.57,0:47:55.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fs50}Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.65,0:48:00.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我觉得冷了\N{\fs50}It's getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.91,0:48:02.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.20,0:48:04.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我带你进屋 - 好\N{\fs50}-Let me bring ya inside. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.68,0:48:14.90,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx107\fscy157\c&Hf0f5f5\fad(500,500)\pos(228.8,744.4)}十年后
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.16,0:48:11.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 回来了\N{\fs50}Okay. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.94,0:48:14.90,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx71\fscy114\c&Hf0f5f5\fad(500,500)\pos(211.2,813.2)}2023年
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.38,0:48:16.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fs50}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.26,0:48:19.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 给你暖暖身子 - 好\N{\fs50}-We'll get you warmed up. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.09,0:49:41.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你吃药了吗？\N{\fs50}Did you take your pills?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.75,0:49:42.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.44,0:50:05.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一片橙色的\N{\fs50}One orangey,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.03,0:50:13.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一片小白药片 还有一片又大又圆\N{\fs50}a little whitey, and a big roundy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.48,0:51:24.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,花了大半夜的时间 现在我累坏了\N{\fs50}Took most of the night. I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.86,0:51:26.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真该死\N{\fs50}Goddamnit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.53,0:51:29.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你在开什么玩笑\N{\fs50}You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.45,0:51:32.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不想你在轮椅上打瞌睡\N{\fs50}I don't want you fallin' asleep in the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.33,0:51:33.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不会那样\N{\fs50}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.14,0:51:34.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你会的 接下来脚就会缺血发青\N{\fs50}You will, and then your feet get blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.62,0:51:36.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 比—— - 我不想和你争这个\N{\fs50}-Bill-- -I'm not fighting about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.12,0:51:38.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 快回到床上 - 我向你保证 我会醒着\N{\fs50}-Back in bed. -I promise you, I'm gonna stay up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.50,0:51:39.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fs50}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.19,0:51:41.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为这将是我人生的最后一天\N{\fs50}'Cause this is my last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.39,0:51:55.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如\N{\fs50}What,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.27,0:51:57.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果我们找个医生看看呢？\N{\fs50}what if we find a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.73,0:52:00.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,说不定帮得了我们的人出现了呢？\N{\fs50}What if someone shows up who can help?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.98,0:52:04.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔 谁会来啊？挨家挨户推销核磁共振成像仪的推销员吗？\N{\fs50}Who's coming, Bill? The door-to-door MRI salesman?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.57,0:52:08.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这病在世界崩坏之前就是绝症\N{\fs50}There wasn't anything to cure this before the world fell apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.78,0:52:11.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我已经决定了\N{\fs50}I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.37,0:52:18.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fs50}Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.25,0:52:23.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fs50}Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.59,0:52:31.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,坐近点\N{\fs50}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.94,0:52:46.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 我不会给你讲\N{\fs50}Well, I'm not gonna give you the
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.48,0:52:48.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“每一天都是上帝的恩赐”这样的话\N{\fs50}"every day was a wonderful gift from God" speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.03,0:52:51.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我经历过很多不如意\N{\fs50}I've had a lot of bad days.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.61,0:52:54.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,与你生活时 也有不开心的日子\N{\fs50}I've had bad days with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.12,0:53:02.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但和你在一起度过的美好时光 比跟任何人都要多\N{\fs50}But I've had more good days with you than with anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.21,0:53:05.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就再多给我一天美好时光吧\N{\fs50}Just give me one more good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.92,0:53:11.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从现在开始 帮我烤些面包\N{\fs50}Starting now. Make me some toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.43,0:53:18.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,带我去时装店\N{\fs50}Then take me to the boutique,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.64,0:53:22.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我来给咱俩挑些衣服\N{\fs50}where I'll pick outfits for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.69,0:53:24.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要穿我为你挑的衣服\N{\fs50}You'll wear what I ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.65,0:53:29.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,接下来我们结婚\N{\fs50}and we'll get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.40,0:53:33.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,再做一顿美味的晚餐\N{\fs50}And you'll cook a delicious dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.70,0:53:39.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后把全部的药片磨碎成粉\N{\fs50}Then you will crush all of these up,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.37,0:53:42.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放到我的酒里\N{\fs50}put them in my wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.63,0:53:47.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我把酒喝完后\N{\fs50}I will drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.05,0:53:51.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你拉着我的手\N{\fs50}Then you will take me by my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.42,0:53:54.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,带我去我们的床上\N{\fs50}bring me to our bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.22,0:54:00.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我会在你的怀里睡过去\N{\fs50}and I will fall asleep in your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.20,0:54:16.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fs50}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.99,0:54:21.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你爱我吗？\N{\fs50}Do you love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.42,0:54:27.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fs50}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.67,0:54:33.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那就依照我盼望的那样爱我吧\N{\fs50}Then love me the way I want you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.09,0:55:01.93,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-仅边框,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx71\fscy114\c&H224347\fs48\pos(640,464.4)}主街
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.89,0:55:06.98,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-仅边框,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx71\fscy114\c&H224347\fs48\frx0\fry10\pos(1443.2,219.6)}主街
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.56,0:56:51.54,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-仅边框,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\c&H06090d\pos(569.6,766.8)\bord1.5}博若莱村庄级
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.15,0:59:03.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,够了吗？\N{\fs50}Will it be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.03,0:59:07.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.49,0:59:55.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你直接把药加瓶里了？\N{\fs50}Were there already pills in the bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.70,0:59:58.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,药量足以干掉一匹马\N{\fs50}Enough to kill a horse.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.75,1:00:03.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这不是戏剧结尾时悲剧式自杀\N{\fs50}This isn't the tragic suicide at the end of the play.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.63,1:00:05.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我已经老了\N{\fs50}I'm old.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.38,1:00:10.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也活够了\N{\fs50}I'm satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.51,1:00:16.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是我活着的意义\N{\fs50}And you were my purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.61,1:00:27.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不赞同你这么做\N{\fs50}I do not support this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.32,1:00:31.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我应该感到愤怒\N{\fs50}I should be furious.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.66,1:00:37.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但从客观的角度来说\N{\fs50}But from an objective point of view,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.42,1:00:43.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,确实异常浪漫\N{\fs50}it's incredibly romantic.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.02,1:01:01.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,带我上床去吧\N{\fs50}Take me to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.61,1:02:12.99,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)\fs120\c&H497498\b1\bord2\shad5\frx358\fry344\pos(1038.4,694.8)}林肯镇
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.61,1:02:12.99,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-仅边框,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)\bord2\3c&H332026\fs72\pos(1067.2,821.2)\frz358.9\frx4\fry344}始建于1764年
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.61,1:02:12.99,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-仅边框,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)\fs72\frx358\fry344\frz4.474\bord2\3c&H332026\pos(1046.4,546)}欢迎来到
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.18,1:02:24.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别乱跑\N{\fs50}Stay there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.27,1:02:31.55,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-仅边框,,0,0,0,,{\fs96\b1\frx352\fry350\3c&H0b1216\bord4\pos(1108.8,440.4)}危险\N高压电
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.98,1:03:13.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我勒个大槽\N{\fs50}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.17,1:03:13.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔？\N{\fs50}Bill?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.20,1:03:18.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,弗兰克？\N{\fs50}Frank?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.58,1:03:26.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你待在这儿 听到什么或看到什么\N{\fs50}You stay there. Ya hear anything, you see anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.96,1:03:27.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,直接喊\N{\fs50}yell.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.58,1:03:30.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,万一他们不在了呢？\N{\fs50}What if they're gone?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.51,1:04:24.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉？\N{\fs50}Ellie?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.56,1:04:34.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔留下的信\N{\fs50}It's from Bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.57,1:04:43.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“致某人 但八成是乔尔“\N{\fs50}"To whomever, but probably Joel."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.41,1:04:46.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想我是他说的“某人”\N{\fs50}I figured I fell under "whomever."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.25,1:04:49.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有这个\N{\fs50}Came with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.01,1:05:01.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那么 他们已经死了？\N{\fs50}So they're dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.68,1:05:11.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你想读吗？\N{\fs50}You wanna?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.69,1:05:15.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,继续 你来读吧\N{\fs50}Go ahead. You do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.57,1:05:23.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“2023年8月29日\N{\fs50}"August 29, 2023.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.78,1:05:27.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“当你读到了这封信 请不要进卧室\N{\fs50}"If you find this, please do not come into the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.66,1:05:31.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“我们开着窗 这样整座房子就不会很难闻\N{\fs50}"We left a window open so the house wouldn't smell,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.41,1:05:33.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“可或许还是会引人注意\N{\fs50}"but it will probably be a sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.17,1:05:35.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“乔尔 我猜发现这封信的人是你\N{\fs50}"I'm guessing you found this, Joel,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.75,1:05:37.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“如果是其他人 早就被电死了\N{\fs50}"because anyone else would've been electrocuted
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.84,1:05:42.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“或者被我的陷阱炸飞 呵呵呵呵呵呵呵呵\N{\fs50}"or blown up by one of my traps. Hehehehehehehehe.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.84,1:05:46.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“屋里的东西随便你拿\N{\fs50}"Take anything you need.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.97,1:05:49.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“地堡的密码和大门密码数字一样 只不过是倒过来的\N{\fs50}"The bunker code is the same as the gate code but in reverse.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.64,1:05:53.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“我从不喜欢你这个人\N{\fs50}"Anyway, I never liked you,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.60,1:05:57.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“但我们算得上朋友 差不多吧\N{\fs50}"but still, it's like we're friends, almost.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.07,1:05:59.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“我尊敬你\N{\fs50}"And I respect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.07,1:06:02.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“因此 我要告诉你一些事情 因为你应该是\N{\fs50}"So, I'm gonna tell you something because you're probably
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.53,1:06:04.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“唯一能理解的人\N{\fs50}"the only person who will understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.49,1:06:09.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“我曾经恨透了这个世界 当所有人都将死掉的时候 我非常高兴\N{\fs50}"I used to hate the world and I was happy when everyone died.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.91,1:06:15.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“但我错了 我发现还有一个人值得拯救\N{\fs50}"But I was wrong, because there was one person worth saving.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.92,1:06:18.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“我这么做了\N{\fs50}"That's what I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.13,1:06:20.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“我不光救了他\N{\fs50}"I saved him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.96,1:06:22.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“还一直保护他\N{\fs50}"Then I protected him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.22,1:06:25.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“这就是你我这样的人存在的意义\N{\fs50}"That's why men like you and me are here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.97,1:06:27.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“我们有任务要做\N{\fs50}"We have a job to do,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.30,1:06:31.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“上帝保佑那些挡我们路的混蛋们\N{\fs50}"and God help any motherfuckers who stand in our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.52,1:06:36.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“你可以拿走我的全部武器和装备\N{\fs50}"I leave you all of my weapons and equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.94,1:06:38.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“用这些东西来保护——”\N{\fs50}Use them to keep--"
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.66,1:06:54.23,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\frz35.63\fs80\b1\fn宋体\pos(652.8,566.8)}保护泰丝的安全
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.50,1:07:01.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别乱跑\N{\fs50}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.47,1:08:16.29,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fs96\pos(435.2,803.6)}硫酸
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.17,1:08:29.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,给我看看你的胳膊\N{\fs50}Show me your arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.23,1:08:42.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我刚刚处理好卡车电池\N{\fs50}I just finished makin' a truck battery.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.69,1:08:44.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在正在充电\N{\fs50}It's charging right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.77,1:08:45.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.50,1:08:47.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我有个弟弟在怀俄明州\N{\fs50}And I have a brother out in Wyoming.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.23,1:08:50.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他可能惹上了麻烦 我要去那儿找他\N{\fs50}He's in some kinda trouble, and I'm heading out there to find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.99,1:08:52.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他曾经是火萤的一员\N{\fs50}He used to be a Firefly.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.49,1:08:55.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我猜他知道其他火萤成员的下落\N{\fs50}And my guess is he knows where some of them are out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.95,1:08:58.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们或许可以把你带到那个不知在哪的实验室\N{\fs50}Maybe they can get you to wherever this lab is.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.25,1:08:59.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.83,1:09:03.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,关于泰丝 听着\N{\fs50}Listen, about Tess.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.50,1:09:10.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果我带你上路 你要遵守规矩\N{\fs50}If I'm takin' you with me, there's some rules you gotta follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.59,1:09:13.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,第一条 不要提起泰丝 无论何时\N{\fs50}Rule one, you don't bring up Tess. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.39,1:09:17.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,实话说 往事留给自己就好\N{\fs50}Matter of fact, we can just keep our histories to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.18,1:09:20.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,第二条 你别跟其他人说你的\N{\fs50}Rule two, you don't tell anyone about your
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.02,1:09:22.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,身体情况\N{\fs50}condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.98,1:09:24.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有人看到那个咬痕 不会多想\N{\fs50}They see that bite mark, they won't think it through.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.94,1:09:26.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,会直接开枪干掉你\N{\fs50}They'll just shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.69,1:09:29.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,第三条 无论我说什么 你照做就好\N{\fs50}Rule three, you do what I say when I say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.90,1:09:31.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 听明白了吗？ - 明白了\N{\fs50}-We clear? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.65,1:09:32.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,重复一遍\N{\fs50}Repeat it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.28,1:09:37.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你说什么就是什么\N{\fs50}What you say goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.67,1:09:46.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.26,1:09:52.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在要干嘛？\N{\fs50}So what now?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.93,1:09:55.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把能拿的都带上\N{\fs50}We grab what we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.35,1:10:09.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我了个去\N{\fs50}Ho-ly shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.44,1:10:13.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这家伙真是个天才\N{\fs50}This guy was a genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.86,1:10:16.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么音乐一直在响？\N{\fs50}Why was the music on?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.70,1:10:19.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,倘若他每隔几周不重设倒计时\N{\fs50}If he didn't reset the countdown every few weeks,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.70,1:10:22.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,广播上就会播放这个列表上的音乐\N{\fs50}this playlist would run over the radio.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.08,1:10:24.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,80年代的歌\N{\fs50}'80s.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.00,1:10:27.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从那边拿几个罐头\N{\fs50}Grab some cans from over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.42,1:10:30.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,挑那些没有凹陷也没有胀气的\N{\fs50}Nothin' dented or swollen.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.30,1:10:33.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fs50}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.65,1:10:34.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,千万别想\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.89,1:10:38.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这一整面墙都是枪\N{\fs50}There's a wall of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.01,1:10:59.97,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1016,838.8)}女士衬衫\N小号-中号
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.01,1:11:00.22,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0c1216\pos(217.6,915.6)\frz6.493}长袖衬衫
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.22,1:11:06.73,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-仅边框,,0,0,0,,{\frz355\fs80\b1\3c&H0f1c21\bord4\pos(988.8,442)}万能充电器
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.29,1:11:06.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,再多等一个小时\N{\fs50}Needs another hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.96,1:11:09.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们还有热水！\N{\fs50}They have hot water!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.42,1:11:10.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我要洗个澡\N{\fs50}I'm takin' a shower.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.96,1:11:12.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后 你也得洗\N{\fs50}And then you're showering
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.63,1:11:14.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说真的\N{\fs50}because seriously.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.30,1:12:00.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fs50}Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.35,1:12:04.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哇 你可真帅\N{\fs50}Well, don't you look pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.97,1:12:05.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fs50}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.77,1:12:08.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fs50}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.83,1:12:33.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你第一次坐车？\N{\fs50}It's your first time in a car?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.11,1:12:34.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这看起来就像一艘太空船\N{\fs50}It's like a spaceship.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.50,1:12:36.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 这看起来像一辆破烂雪佛兰S10皮卡\N{\fs50}No, it's like a piece of shit Chevy S10,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.50,1:12:39.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但它能把我们带到目的地 应该吧\N{\fs50}but it'll get us there, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.43,1:12:41.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,系好安全带\N{\fs50}Seatbelt.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.06,1:12:49.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这叫安全带\N{\fs50}Seatbelt.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.98,1:12:52.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这也太酷了\N{\fs50}So cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.74,1:13:07.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你能别弄了吗？\N{\fs50}Would ya leave it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.08,1:13:09.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把它放回去\N{\fs50}Put it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.29,1:13:10.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fs50}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.38,1:13:16.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 不 停下\N{\fs50}Oh, no, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.34,1:13:17.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别动它 别动\N{\fs50}No, leave it. Leave it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.84,1:13:19.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这首歌不错 琳达·朗丝黛的歌\N{\fs50}This is good. This is Linda Ronstadt.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.01,1:13:21.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道琳达·朗丝黛是谁吗？\N{\fs50}Do you know who Linda Ronstadt is?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.55,1:13:23.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你明知道我没听过她是谁\N{\fs50}You know I don't know who Linda Ronstadt is.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.39,1:13:32.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fs50}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.52,1:13:37.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有点音乐还是不错的\N{\fs50}It's better than nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.23,1:13:39.65,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,直到那一天\N{\fs50}♪ Wait for the day ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.33,1:13:41.33,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,Linda Ronstadt《Long, Long Time》，发表于1970年
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.49,1:13:44.24,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,你终究离我而去\N{\fs50} ♪ You'll go away ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.53,1:13:51.08,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,你早已告诫我\N{\fs50}♪ Knowin' that you warned me ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.16,1:13:55.25,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,为爱所付出的代价\N{\fs50}♪ Of the price I'd have to pay ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.33,1:14:00.05,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,人生无奈 一直在失去\N{\fs50}♪ And life's full of loss ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.84,1:14:06.26,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,谁又能计算清楚得失\N{\fs50}♪ Who knows the cost ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.68,1:14:12.06,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,活在回忆之中\N{\fs50}♪ Livin' in the memory ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.14,1:14:16.27,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,你未曾爱过我\N{\fs50}♪ Of a love that never was ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.35,1:14:23.24,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,因我不顾一切\N{\fs50}♪ 'Cause I've done everything I know ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.32,1:14:27.91,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,只为能使你回心转意\N{\fs50}♪ To try and change your mind ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.99,1:14:33.12,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,此情不移\N{\fs50}♪ And I think I'm gonna love you ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.20,1:14:39.84,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,地久天长\N{\fs50}♪ For a long, long time ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.14,1:15:39.19,Info-TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\fs85\b1\pos(960,935.644)}关注衣柜字幕组\N{\fs50}小红书 微信公众号 西瓜视频@衣柜军团\N微博 B站@衣柜军团发声筒\N{\fs50}译制人员\N{\fs50} 北落微博@北落不会呀 B站@北落yubekyu\N疾火微博@疾火_凡庸之火将把所有高贵屠戮 B站@尘蕊蝶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.85,1:14:53.98,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,爱意会永存\N{\fs50}♪ Love will abide ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.69,1:14:59.11,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,不需患得患失\N{\fs50}♪ Take things in stride ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.57,1:15:05.11,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,这番话似乎是金玉之言\N{\fs50}♪ Sounds like good advice ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.20,1:15:09.57,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,但我身边 并无一人\N{\fs50}♪ But there's no one at my side ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.66,1:15:14.33,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,时间会冲淡\N{\fs50}♪ And time washes clean ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.91,1:15:19.33,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,爱恋的伤痕\N{\fs50}♪ Love's wounds unseen ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.05,1:15:26.34,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,曾有人对我如此说道\N{\fs50}♪ That's what someone told me ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.42,1:15:30.72,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,话里的深意 我却一无所知\N{\fs50}♪ But I don't know what it means ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.80,1:15:35.35,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,因我不顾一切…\N{\fs50}♪ 'Cause I've done everything I know... ♪
